              <p>If you're planning a kitchen remodel in Media, PA, one of the first questions on your mind is probably: <strong>how much do kitchen cabinets actually cost?</strong> It's a fair question — cabinets are the single biggest line item in most kitchen renovations, and prices can vary wildly depending on the type, material, and contractor you choose.</p>
              <p>Whether you're a Media, PA homeowner, a Delaware County resident ready to upgrade, or just doing early research, this guide gives you a complete, honest breakdown of what to expect in 2026 — from budget stock cabinets to fully custom built-ins.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Average Cost Section -->
