              <h2>Average Kitchen Cabinet Cost in Media, PA</h2>
              <p>Kitchen cabinet costs in Media, PA and the surrounding Delaware County area depend heavily on the cabinet type you choose. Here are the three main tiers:</p>

              <div class="post-table-wrap">
                <table class="post-table" aria-label="Kitchen cabinet cost ranges by type">
