                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="col">Cabinet Type</th>
                      <th scope="col">Typical Kitchen Cost</th>
                      <th scope="col">Per Linear Foot</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Stock Cabinets</td>
                      <td>$3,000 – $8,000</td>
                      <td>$60 – $200</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Semi-Custom Cabinets</td>
                      <td>$8,000 – $20,000</td>
                      <td>$100 – $650</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Custom Cabinets</td>
                      <td>$20,000 – $50,000+</td>
                      <td>$500 – $1,200+</td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>

              <p>Small kitchens typically range $3,000–$12,000, while large open-concept kitchens can reach $30,000–$60,000 for premium options.</p>
            </div>

